{"seq":2,"slug":"stocktake-writeoff-and-variance-declaration","title":"盘点核销流程与差异申报：从盘点到账册调整的闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/bonded-stocktake-writeoff/stocktake-writeoff-and-variance-declaration","wordCount":2989,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"盘点核销流程与差异申报-从盘点到账册调整的闭环\">盘点核销流程与差异申报：从盘点到账册调整的闭环</h1><p>保税仓的盘点从来不是「数一遍货」。数货只产生一个实物数，而监管要的是这个实物数与账册底账之间差额的<strong>法律解释</strong>：差额是溢余、短少还是灭失，每一种对应完全不同的处置——补登、补税、还是免责。工程上真正难的不是盘点执行，而是盘点之后那条把「实物差」变成「账册调整 + 申报动作」的闭环。它必须可复算、可举证，否则一次盘点就足以让账册进入核查的死角。</p>\n<p>本文只谈这条闭环：制度给了它什么周期约束、差异有哪几类归因、系统该怎样把一次盘库安全地落到账册上。账册本身的层级与归并结构见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../eledger-annotation-list/e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing\">电子账册层级与商品项备案</a>，WMS 数量到账册数量的换算管道见 <a href=\"../wms-customs-integration/wms-inventory-to-ledger-data-mapping\">WMS 库存数据到账册底账的映射</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-盘点是一次-对账-归因-调整-的闭环\">核心概念：盘点是一次「对账—归因—调整」的闭环</h2><p>把盘点理解为一个状态机而不是一个动作清单，是设计的第一原则。一次盘库的生命周期是四步，任何一步缺失都会让后续核查无法闭环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;① 冻结账册&lt;br/&gt;盘点基准时点 t0&lt;br/&gt;暂挂该时点后的记账&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;② 实物点数&lt;br/&gt;货位 × 项号 × 批次&lt;br/&gt;生成盘点单&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;③ 差异归因&lt;br/&gt;Δ = 实物 − 账面&lt;br/&gt;溢余 / 短少 / 灭失&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;④ 账册调整 + 申报&lt;br/&gt;补登 / 补税 / 核注清单&lt;br/&gt;+ 差异说明留档&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;⑤ 报核&lt;br/&gt;向主管海关报送&lt;br/&gt;核销周期结算&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;是否平账?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;核销完成&lt;br/&gt;账实相符&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| C\">graph TD\n  A[\"① 冻结账册&lt;br/&gt;盘点基准时点 t0&lt;br/&gt;暂挂该时点后的记账\"] --&gt; B[\"② 实物点数&lt;br/&gt;货位 × 项号 × 批次&lt;br/&gt;生成盘点单\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"③ 差异归因&lt;br/&gt;Δ = 实物 − 账面&lt;br/&gt;溢余 / 短少 / 灭失\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"④ 账册调整 + 申报&lt;br/&gt;补登 / 补税 / 核注清单&lt;br/&gt;+ 差异说明留档\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"⑤ 报核&lt;br/&gt;向主管海关报送&lt;br/&gt;核销周期结算\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"是否平账?\"}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[\"核销完成&lt;br/&gt;账实相符\"]\n  F --&gt;|否| C</pre><p>第一步「冻结基准时点」最容易被忽略，却决定了差异能不能被解释。盘点时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之后仍在发生的入仓/出仓若与盘点并行记账，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 里就混进了在途交易，差异永远归不到因。标准做法是：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对该账册打一个只读快照，此后所有记账动作先入暂挂队列，待盘点结论落定后再按顺序补记。</p>\n<p>差异是一个带符号的量。设项号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的账面数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>账</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i^{\\text{账}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">账</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、盘点数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>实</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i^{\\text{实}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">实</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>实</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>账</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i = q_i^{\\text{实}} - q_i^{\\text{账}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">实</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">账</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为溢余、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为短少。账实平衡的充要条件是所有项号同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。实践中几乎做不到逐项为零，制度允许的余地在于<strong>把非零差异按性质分流</strong>。分流错了，短少被当成溢余登记，就是一条实打实的违规。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>真实含义</th>\n<th>处置方向</th>\n<th>制度参照</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>溢余</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实物多于账册，常见于漏记账、归并错误</td>\n<td>补登账册（补记入仓）</td>\n<td>账册应如实反映库存，不得隐瞒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合理损耗</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 小额</td>\n<td>自然挥发、破碎、计量误差</td>\n<td>按备案损耗率核减，报核时说明</td>\n<td>参照《加工贸易单耗管理办法》（海关总署令第 155 号）工艺损耗思路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短少</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实物短缺且无正当理由</td>\n<td><strong>照章补税</strong>，经营企业承担</td>\n<td>《海关对保税仓库及所存货物的管理规定》（海关总署令第 105 号）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灭失/毁损</td>\n<td>归零</td>\n<td>火灾、水浸、丢失</td>\n<td>不可抗力免责，否则补税并可能处罚</td>\n<td>海关总署令第 105 号对灭失货物的处置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区分是<strong>短少</strong>与<strong>合理损耗</strong>之间的那条线。两者符号相同，处置却从「核减备案损耗率」跳到「全额补税」。这条线不是企业单方划定的：损耗率须在备案时申报并经海关认可，超出部分一律按短少处理。系统必须把「备案损耗率」作为项号的<strong>带版本属性</strong>存储，而非运营页面上可随手调整的参数——否则每次报核都能临时把短少解释成损耗，核查时无法举证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定期盘库的制度周期与报核约束\">定期盘库的制度周期与报核约束</h2><p>保税仓库的盘库不是企业自选节奏。依据《中华人民共和国海关对保税仓库及所存货物的管理规定》（海关总署令第 105 号发布，<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>），保税仓库经营企业负有<strong>如实记录和定期向主管海关报送库存情况</strong>的义务，货物进出须凭海关单证记账；短少的货物除不可抗力外由经营企业补缴税款。这一条把「盘点点出的差」直接连到了「钱」——差异不是内部指标，而是可能触发补税的监管事实。</p>\n<p>加工贸易联网账册的核销周期则另有一套。《中华人民共和国海关加工贸易货物监管办法》（海关总署令第 219 号）规定电子账册以企业为单元、按<strong>核销周期</strong>滚动管理，到期报核，周期由主管海关核定。保税仓若同时承载加工业务，就要面对两套账：仓库的库存账与加工账册的核销账。二者核销周期往往不同步，工程上必须允许<strong>同一批实物货对应到两个不同核销期的账册</strong>，而不能假设「一次盘点同时结清所有账」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监管形态</th>\n<th>盘库/核销节奏</th>\n<th>报核对象</th>\n<th>差异后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保税仓库（105 号令）</td>\n<td>定期报送库存情况</td>\n<td>主管海关</td>\n<td>短少部分照章补税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加工贸易联网账册（219 号令）</td>\n<td>按核销周期到期报核</td>\n<td>主管海关</td>\n<td>按单耗核定，节余或短缺分别处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境电商保税备货 1210</td>\n<td>随清单/核注逐票记账，定期盘库</td>\n<td>主管海关</td>\n<td>差异按一般保税货物处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>综保区区内企业</td>\n<td>按海关核定的核算周期</td>\n<td>主管海关（区内机构）</td>\n<td>区内交易不涉税单，差异仅影响区内账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上表的实际口径以主管海关和「中国国际贸易单一窗口」（<a href=\"https://www.singlewindow.cn/\">singlewindow.cn</a>）当期要求为准。系统的职责不是复刻制度文本，而是让每一类差异都能被<strong>稳定地映射到一次可申报的动作</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异申报的技术闭环-从盘点单到核注清单\">差异申报的技术闭环：从盘点单到核注清单</h2><p>盘点结论要落到账册上，只能走海关接受的单据通道。保税监管体系里，账册库存的增减由<strong>核注清单</strong>驱动（金关二期账册体系，<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>），核放单负责卡口放行。差异调整不能直接改账册，必须生成对应申报单：<strong>溢余</strong>生成入账方向核注清单补登实物；<strong>短少</strong>生成出账方向核注清单核减库存并计算应补税款；<strong>合理损耗</strong>报核时以损耗说明附列，按备案损耗率核减。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  P[&quot;盘点单&lt;br/&gt;项号 + Δ_i + 归因&quot;] --&gt; R{&quot;归因分流&quot;}&#10;  R --&gt;|溢余| I[&quot;入账核注清单&lt;br/&gt;库存 +|Δ|&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt;|短少| O[&quot;出账核注清单&lt;br/&gt;库存 −|Δ|&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt;|损耗| L[&quot;报核损耗说明&lt;br/&gt;按备案率核减&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; L2[&quot;账册底账调整&quot;]&#10;  O --&gt; L2&#10;  L --&gt; L2&#10;  O --&gt; T[&quot;补税计算&lt;br/&gt;完税价格 × 税率&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; D[&quot;后续补税/说明留档&quot;]\">graph LR\n  P[\"盘点单&lt;br/&gt;项号 + Δ_i + 归因\"] --&gt; R{\"归因分流\"}\n  R --&gt;|溢余| I[\"入账核注清单&lt;br/&gt;库存 +|Δ|\"]\n  R --&gt;|短少| O[\"出账核注清单&lt;br/&gt;库存 −|Δ|\"]\n  R --&gt;|损耗| L[\"报核损耗说明&lt;br/&gt;按备案率核减\"]\n  I --&gt; L2[\"账册底账调整\"]\n  O --&gt; L2\n  L --&gt; L2\n  O --&gt; T[\"补税计算&lt;br/&gt;完税价格 × 税率\"]\n  T --&gt; D[\"后续补税/说明留档\"]</pre><p>这条链路有一个硬约束：<strong>每一张由盘点生成的核注清单，都必须携带可回溯到原始盘点单的引用</strong>。核注清单不是凭空造出来的记账指令，而是一条有来源的调整：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>核注清单</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext> source_ref </mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>盘点单</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext> snapshot </mtext></mpadded></mover><msub><mtext>账册快照</mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{核注清单} \\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{source\\_ref}\\ } \\text{盘点单} \\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{snapshot}\\ } \\text{账册快照}_{t_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核注清单</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">source_ref</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">盘点单</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snapshot</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9334em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">账册快照</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>有了这条引用，核查人员拿到任意一笔账册变动，都能顺着 <code>source_ref</code> 追到是哪次盘库、哪个时点、哪个项号产生的，而不是一句「系统调整」。这正是保税监管里「可举证」的工程含义。</p>\n<p>短少的补税以<strong>完税价格</strong>为基数，取决于该批货落地时的税率与价格口径：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>应补税额</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{应补税额} = \\sum_{i:\\ \\Delta_i &lt; 0} \\lvert \\Delta_i \\rvert \\cdot p_i \\cdot \\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应补税额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1498em;vertical-align:-0.3998em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3998em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是完税价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是适用税率。工程上禁止在盘点时点用「当前价」估算：价格、汇率、税率都必须锚定在该批货的<strong>原始进口凭证</strong>上，否则补税金额算错，反而制造新的核查差异。补税金额应作为独立计算的中间结果留档，而不是写死在核注清单里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账册调整的一致性-拒绝就地改写\">账册调整的一致性：拒绝就地改写</h2><p>盘点调整最常被运营催促的一句话是「差了一点点，直接把账册数改过来」。这在保税场景里是纯粹的违规：<strong>账册底账是被海关接受的记账事实，不是企业可随意覆盖的可变状态</strong>。正确的调整永远是「以新单据产生新底账行、并保留旧行」，落地有三条不可退让的约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>底账追加写</strong>。账册库存的每一次变动追加一条带时间的底账行，账面余额是这些行的累加，而不是一个 UPDATE 覆盖的字段。任何盘点调整都是追加一条新的、方向明确的底账行。</li>\n<li><strong>映射版本绑定</strong>。调整行必须固化当时生效的料号归并版本与计量换算系数版本；三个月后复核这笔调整时，必须能用当时的版本复算出同样的数量，否则调整无法被复现。</li>\n<li><strong>盘点单不可变</strong>。盘点单一旦确认就冻结；如需修正，走「冲销原盘点单 + 生成新盘点单」的方式，而不是编辑原单。这与 <a href=\"../eledger-annotation-list/ledger-change-consolidation-and-exception\">电子账册的变更与异常处理</a> 中「关旧行、开新行」的版本化思路同源。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这三条一起保证了账册调整的可审计性：底账永远只增不改，每次调整都有来源、有版本、有原始盘点单。核查时看到的不是「账现在是平的」，而是「账为什么是平的」。</p>\n<p>需要特别防范的一种反模式是<strong>用盘点掩盖未申报的出入库</strong>。若某批货实际已出区但未走核注、账面仍挂着，盘点会出现短少；把它记成「合理损耗」就掩盖了一次逃证。因此短少归因必须默认从严：除非有备案损耗率且差额落在其内，否则一律按短少走补税通道。系统应把「超出备案损耗率的差额」标为需人工复核的异常，而非静默核减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报核-把一个周期的差异一次性结清\">报核：把一个周期的差异一次性结清</h2><p>报核是核销周期的收口动作，也是差异闭环的终点：它把周期内的盘点差异、常规进出记账与损耗说明汇总，向主管海关报送并等待核销结论。报核质量取决于前面所有环节的留档——盘点单、快照时点与归因结论；核注清单及其 <code>source_ref</code>；短少的补税计算与缴款凭证；损耗的备案率引用。</p>\n<p>报核不是「把所有差异清零」，而是「把所有差异解释清楚」。一个账实相符的核销结论，恰恰是大量被正确归因、正确申报的差异累积出来的。把差异藏起来换来的一时平静，核查时会以补税、滞纳金与信用降级的形式连本带利还回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>盘点核销闭环可压缩成四个必须同时成立的工程条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基准确定</strong>：盘点时点冻结账册快照，此后记账入暂挂队列，差异才可归因。</li>\n<li><strong>归因从严</strong>：溢余补登、短少补税、损耗须在备案率以内；超出损耗率一律按短少处理。</li>\n<li><strong>调整留痕</strong>：核注清单必须引用原始盘点单，底账只追加不覆盖，映射与换算系数随行版本化。</li>\n<li><strong>报核可举证</strong>：以完整留档把差异解释清楚，而非把差异清零。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>制度依据以《海关对保税仓库及所存货物的管理规定》（海关总署令第 105 号）、《中华人民共和国海关加工贸易货物监管办法》（海关总署令第 219 号）及主管海关当期口径为准；申报通道以「中国国际贸易单一窗口」（<a href=\"https://www.singlewindow.cn/\">singlewindow.cn</a>）的实际接口为准。</p>\n<p><strong>参考来源</strong>：海关总署令第 105 号《海关对保税仓库及所存货物的管理规定》；第 219 号《中华人民共和国海关加工贸易货物监管办法》；第 155 号《加工贸易单耗管理办法》；<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>；<a href=\"https://www.singlewindow.cn/\">中国国际贸易单一窗口</a>。文号与条款以海关总署当期发布文本为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"盘点核销流程与差异申报：从盘点到账册调整的闭环","id":"盘点核销流程与差异申报-从盘点到账册调整的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：盘点是一次「对账—归因—调整」的闭环","id":"核心概念-盘点是一次-对账-归因-调整-的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"定期盘库的制度周期与报核约束","id":"定期盘库的制度周期与报核约束"},{"level":2,"text":"差异申报的技术闭环：从盘点单到核注清单","id":"差异申报的技术闭环-从盘点单到核注清单"},{"level":2,"text":"账册调整的一致性：拒绝就地改写","id":"账册调整的一致性-拒绝就地改写"},{"level":2,"text":"报核：把一个周期的差异一次性结清","id":"报核-把一个周期的差异一次性结清"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"账实相符模型：库存差异分类、平衡表与容差口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/bonded-stocktake-writeoff/stock-balance-and-variance-model"},"next":{"title":"核销周期、账册结案与账实不符的合规风险度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/bonded-stocktake-writeoff/writeoff-cycle-and-compliance-risk"}}